/*
  Typography.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 shared surface · 0232 · Typography (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. The web `components/ui/Typography.tsx` is an
  anonymous presentational primitive — its text is a caller-supplied, already-localized prop and it calls no
  `t()` — so there are NO web keys to mirror here. The only entries below are the native a11y additions: the
  "never a blank box" empty leaf (shown when a host passes empty text), with its title and supporting line.

  These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept
  in a per-surface table ("Typography") so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings. In test /
  preview bundles `NSLocalizedString` returns the value below, keeping the labels deterministic.
*/

/* --- Native a11y additions (no web `t()` key exists; the source is anonymous) --- */

/* Title of the empty leaf, shown when a host passes empty text so the surface never renders a bare box. */
"typography.empty.title" = "Nothing to display";

/* Supporting line of the empty leaf. */
"typography.empty.message" = "Text appears here when it becomes available.";
